				<element type="warning_sequence">18</element>
                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING EASING SLOWLY AT CUNNAMULLA BRIDGE </p>
<p>MODERATE FLOODING LIKELY AT ROCKY FROM WEDNESDAY AFTERNOON</p>

				<p/>
				<p>A flood peak is downstream of Cunnamulla Bridge and approaching Rocky as the flood waters flow downstream. </p>
<p/>
<p>Another flood peak has passed Wallen and is approaching Cunnamulla Bridge. This flood peak is likely to cause extended elevated river levels at both Cunnamulla Bridge and Rocky.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Moderate</element>
            </forecast-period>
