                        <text type="flood_status">No current river level observations are available for the Warrego River at Cunnamulla Bridge. However, based on river levels at the nearby automatic gauge, the river level at Cunnamulla Bridge is estimated to have peaked at around the moderate flood level during Tuesday and to be easing slowly just below the moderate flood level, with minor flooding.</text>
                        <text type="warning_prediction">The Warrego River at Cunnamulla Bridge is likely to remain above the minor flood level (6.00 m) for the remainder of the week.</text>
                    </forecast-period>
					
                <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-04T09:22:51+10:00" end-time-local="2026-11-07T12:22:51+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-03T23:22:51Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-07T02:22:51Z"/>
